 fine=GEN,
 cap="Pretty kitchen. Wrong street.\n\nA tired kitchen can be updated; a location can't be moved. 1) The mistake: choosing a home because the kitchen looks great. 2) Paint, floors and kitchens can be updated over time. 3) You can't move the street, and the roof, wiring and foundation can be costly to fix. 4) Ask your home inspector about the big items before you fall for the finishes.\n\nBuying in Brampton? "+INFO+"\n\n"+GEN,
